      "content": "i know a support line won't change the fact that he's gone. it's just constant. i look at his side of the bed and i just feel like i'm stuck in this grey void. it feels like a cruel joke that the rest of the world is just moving on like nothing happened. honestly, i just want to stop feeling this way. i want the emptiness to just go away.\n Balance is emotions. The user user is expressing model gave a a standard empathetic helpful",
